&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;This is a hybrid/ Onsite position.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;For nearly 40 years, Naughty Dog has been crafting best-selling, critically acclaimed games that constantly push the boundaries of narrative, gameplay, and technology. Naughty Dog recently released The Last of Us Part II Remastered as well as a current generation remake of The Last of Us Part I for the PS5. We&#39;re also proud to say that The Last of Us Parts I and II are now available for the first time on PC. Currently, we’re busy at the kennel working on Intergalactic: The Heretic Prophet, and we’d love to find talented individuals to join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Naughty Dog games have long been lauded for their evocative, character-driven stories and attention to detail. We are committed to innovation within our games and as such have curated some of the top creative and technically innovative minds in the industry. We welcome diverse candidates and believe that a broad range of cultural and life experiences contribute to the overall well-being and success of the studio and the titles we craft together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Naughty Dog is looking for a Research Data Analyst to join our User Research team and help us better understand how players engage with our games. In this role, you’ll work closely with Sony Game Analytics and development teams to turn player data into insight that can directly support creative and production decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;This position is ideal for someone who is curious, analytical, and deeply interested in how player behavior connects to game systems and design intent. Beyond working with technical tools and valuable reports, you’ll be expected to identify meaningful trends, surfacing potential issues, to help teams understand the “why” behind player patterns. A strong candidate will be comfortable working across disciplines and excited to contribute to our games.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Analyze gameplay telemetry, player feedback, and research findings to identify trends, friction points, and opportunities across systems and features.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Translate complex datasets into clear insights and recommendations that inform design, prioritization, and development strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain dashboards and reporting tools to communicate key metrics and progress over time with tools like Tableau and Omni.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Partner with Sony Game Analytics, Gameplay, Engineering, and Design to support telemetry design, event tracking, and data quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with User Research to connect quantitative analysis with qualitative findings from studies and playtests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Participate in research efforts to better understand player behavior firsthand and identify new measurement opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Skills you will use:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;3–5 years of experience in data analysis, analytics, UX research support, or a related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Experience working with telemetry data and game analytics workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and statistical skills, including experience with SQL, Python, R, MongoDB, or similar tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Experience with analytics platforms such as Tableau, Looker, or similar platforms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;A deep curiosity about player psychology, motivation, and behavior.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;High attention to detail, with a strong sense of ownership and accountability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Ability to effectively present information to top management and key stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;A collaborative mindset and adaptability to the ever changing needs of video game production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Advanced degree in Data Science, Statistics, Mathematics, Computer Science, Economics, Psychology, Human-Computer Interaction, Cognitive Science, or a related quantitative or research focused field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with narrative, single player game research and player experience evaluation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of probability, statistics, and applied mathematical reasoning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Ability to interpret technical and research materials and communicate findings clearly in reports and presentations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Possesses a high degree of technical curiosity, regularly exploring how tools work under the hood.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Prior experience with AAA console or PC game development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;#LI-AB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At SIE, working with our partners, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the individual base pay range may vary based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role is eligible for benefit offerings that include medical, dental, and vision. Click &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dzconnex.com/summary-of-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below, this is an hourly rate.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$51.83&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$64.76 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
